{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はおいでシャンプー発売記念\n全国握手会の第一回目\n乃木坂46 in 名古屋～ヾ(≧∪≦*)ﾉ〃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天気めっちゃ良かったねえ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日焼け大丈夫～( ; _ ; )？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも天気にも負けんくらい\nみなさん盛り上がってくださって\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月でこの暑さやけん 真夏にLIVEする時なんかは\nそうとう暑いんやろうなあ....\n覚悟しちょかんと（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブ  セットリスト\n・おいでシャンプー\n・狼に口笛を\n・ハウス！\n・乃木坂の詩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の4曲でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛を\nハウス！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2曲とも みなさんから見て\n左側に居って 踊ってたけど\nみなさん見てくれましたかねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハウス！は披露するのが初めてで\n2組みでペアになって\n踊るんですけど\nみさは、ろってぃーと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目を合わせて踊るんやけど\nいつも 笑わせてくるに！！\nふふって笑っちゃう ///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして らりんの誕生日を\nメンバー ファンのみなさんと一緒に\nサプライズで祝ったね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりん本当におめでとう！\nいつも仲良くさせてもらってるけど\n本当らりんが大好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒居ってめっちゃ楽やし\n話しやすいし相談とかもできる仲やし\n(だと みさは思ってる)笑\nらりんが居なきゃみさはだめだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、この子は唯一\nわたくしのスクール水着姿を\n見たことがあるのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ね、せいらりん。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当におめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会の方もめっちゃ楽しかった！\nみさは第一レーンで\nさゆりん、川後、まりかと一緒でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンス良かったよ！って\n言ってくれたり\nあとは乃木坂の握手会は来たことあるけど\nみさみさと握手するの初めてって\nいう方がけっこう居たり。\nこういうのも全握のいいところ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂Familyのみなさんと\nまた距離が縮まった気がして\n本当に嬉しかったです...(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方も\nたまにお会いできる方も\nいつも来てくださる方も\nみんなのことが大好きだよ～！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メは 移動のバスで隣やった\nななみと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか みさが寝言いったみたいで\nななみんにめっちゃ笑われた。\nなんて言ったか忘れたけど(´･_･`)\nはずかしいな(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもまだまだ\n全握・個別 続きますので\n引き続きよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに会えて良かったよ！\nゆっくり休んでな(*^^*)\nおやすみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいちゃら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/4387985/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"misa"}],"source":"archive"}